# Payment Gateway Manager — Crave Bakery
# Build Guide for Cursor AI

> **Purpose:** This file guides Cursor through building a dynamic Payment Gateway Manager
> for the Crave Bakery project. The system allows admins to enable/disable payment methods,
> configure API credentials, and control what appears on the checkout page — all without
> touching code.
>
> **Current State:** Stripe and Cash on Delivery are already integrated and working.
> This file refactors them into a scalable gateway management system.
>
> Load alongside: `crave-bakery-project-brief.md` and `cursor-learning-rules.md`

---

## What We Are Building

```
BEFORE (current state):
  Stripe → hardcoded in PaymentController
  Cash on Delivery → hardcoded in CheckoutController
  No admin control over payment methods

AFTER (target state):
  Admin Panel → Settings → Payment Methods
       ↓
  Admin enables/disables Stripe ✅
  Admin enables/disables Cash on Delivery ✅
  Admin fills in Stripe API keys from the UI
  Admin sets sort order (which appears first)
       ↓
  Checkout page reads enabled gateways dynamically
       ↓
  Customer sees only the active payment methods
       ↓
  Adding a NEW gateway in the future = one new class + one new Vue component
  (zero changes to existing code)
```

