## Security Checklist

```
✅ All gateway API secrets stored encrypted in DB (using Laravel encrypt())
✅ Secret values never returned to frontend — only "filled: true/false" indicator
✅ Admin can update keys — blank fields keep existing encrypted values
✅ Payment verification always done server-side — never trust frontend
✅ Gateway name validated server-side against allowed values ('in:stripe,cod')
✅ Order ownership verified before creating payment intent
✅ Webhook endpoint excluded from CSRF but verified by Stripe signature
```

